     <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/9e38/0cf2/413420_normal.png?m=1789083210\" alt=\"413420\" data-uid=\"413420\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/413420\">413420</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 11:31:16 +08:00\">20h 34m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>关注 tibo 的 x 就可以获得一手情报，非要在这些网站上搞个无基准的预测，没有 ai 的话这些 slop idea 根本不会得到满足</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18145003\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/11bd/dd70/494150_normal.png?m=1632640634\" alt=\"sadfasdfa\" data-uid=\"494150\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/sadfasdfa\">sadfasdfa</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 11:43:45 +08:00\">20h 22m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>没啥问题呀，明天重置，8 号还有机会用，然后一天用完</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18145041\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/cb7e/d3ff/714531_normal.png?m=1761119463\" alt=\"V2Try\" data-uid=\"714531\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/V2Try\">V2Try</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-10-02 12:00:00 +08:00\">20h 6m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>已经 4 张重置卡了，根本用不完，因为一直在用 Claude。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n    